t-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}\">\\(F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a> 的非严格前缀关系，允许F无限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\sigma\\in F}2^{-|\\sigma|}d(\\sigma)\\le2^{-|\\nu|}d(\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{\\sigma\\in F}2^{-|\\sigma|}d(\\sigma)\\le2^{-|\\nu|}d(\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限F按树归纳；一般F取有限部分和上确界。修正源书证明中不正确的逐点等式，所需结论是加权和的≤关系。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.4(i)，印刷206–207，PDF226–227。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-supermartingale","status":"resolved","id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-supermartingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-supermartingale","status":"resolved","id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)$（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}$。设 $F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)$（see [[43-df-prefixfree]]）；$\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]] 的非严格前缀关系，允许F无限。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)$（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}$。设 $F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)$（see [[43-df-prefixfree]]）；$\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]] 的非严格前缀关系，允许F无限。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)$（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}$。设 $F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}$ 满足